Modifications to Playwright: Kitsune's build (scripts/build.mjs) patches the vendored
files while bundling. The patches (1) report contenteditable roots as textboxes,
(2) hide password field values, and (3) read closed shadow roots through Firefox's
openOrClosedShadowRoot. vendor/playwright/README.md lists them.
